You use some of that precious time to exchange for money (cash), but money itself is meaningless; your time is where all meaning and value reside.
&ldquo;Understanding that money is life energy will make you the master of money. You will clearly know how much life energy you are willing to trade for money. Look around at what you have accumulated, and ask yourself: &lsquo;How much time did I invest in my life to own this&hellip; chair&hellip; car&hellip; complete set of cookware&hellip; diploma on the wall?&rsquo; See how this affects your next purchase.&rdquo;

