Why? The reason is very clear and very simple:
People are Impulsive and Emotional The highest point and the lowest point are both caused by the &ldquo;impulsiveness&rdquo; of a small portion of traders&hellip;
You are destined to be a disciplined person, so, that portion of impulsive trading is destined not to belong to the disciplined you! Believe me, you are a normal person, so it is perfectly normal for occasional hallucinations to appear. However, you are different. How are you different? The difference is that when the hallucination appears, you can recognize it, you clearly know that it is an illusion, which means you can, just like a normal person, shake your head vigorously, shake off that illusion, and continue living and thinking normally&hellip;

